{
  "_comment": [
    "Wrong in a way that is hard to name . On the landmass it keeps to the strange",
    "landforms -- fungal, glowing, floating, dark; in the air it hangs motes no air should hold, each Age drawing",
    "its own look and motion for them, the uncanny-motes step written on purpose.",
    "",
    "Before the sky, a body, the aurora or the stars, a handful of looks that are not quite right: green or",
    "magenta, risen in the west, standing still, too many."
  ],
